      <tr><td><strong>Forge or Ploi + your VPS</strong></td><td>Forge Hobby 12 USD/mo; Ploi Free (1 server, 1 site) or Basic 8 EUR/mo. Plus the VPS</td><td>Push-to-deploy, SSL, workers and cron configured for you on a server you own</td><td>Developers who want automation without platform lock-in</td></tr>
